---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../site-config';

const updatedOn = 'November 10, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Thread & Petal handles website visits, optional Google Analytics, cookies, email enquiries and privacy requests."
>
  <section class="page-heading page-heading-sage">
    <div class="site-container">
      <span class="eyebrow">THE IMPORTANT LITTLE DETAILS</span>
      <h1>Privacy <em>policy.</em></h1>
      <p>We care about handmade things — and about being clear with how this little corner of the internet works.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="site-container policy-wrap">
    <div class="policy-summary">
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="policy-summary-icon">♡</span>
      <div>
        <strong>Privacy at a glance</strong>
        <p>You can enjoy our crochet tutorials without creating an account. We use Cloudflare to host and protect the site, Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand overall site performance, and email to respond when you write to us. Google Analytics is optional and loads only after you agree to analytics cookies. We do not currently run third-party advertising.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-11-10">{updatedOn}</time></p>

    <nav class="policy-nav" aria-label="Privacy policy sections">
      <strong>Jump to a section</strong>
      <a href="#who-we-are">Who we are</a>
      <a href="#information">Information</a>
      <a href="#analytics">Analytics</a>
      <a href="#email">Email</a>
      <a href="#cookies">Cookies</a>
      <a href="#your-rights">Your rights</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="legal-content prose policy-copy">
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>{siteConfig.name}</strong> handles information when you visit <a href="https://threadnpetal.blog/">threadnpetal.blog</a>, read our crochet patterns, follow our links or contact us. It describes our current website services. If we introduce new features such as advertising, forms or mailing lists, we will review and update this policy.</p>

      <section id="who-we-are">
        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p><strong>Website:</strong> {siteConfig.name} — <a href="https://threadnpetal.blog/">threadnpetal.blog</a></p>
        <p><strong>Website operator:</strong> Thread & Petal is an independently maintained crochet blog, operated by an individual based in Morocco. It is not presented as a registered company.</p>
        <p><strong>Operating country:</strong> Morocco</p>
        <p><strong>Privacy contact:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a></p>
        <p>The person operating Thread & Petal determines the purposes and means of the processing described here. For privacy inquiries or identification requests, please use the contact email above.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="information">
        <h2>2. Information processed when you visit</h2>
        <p>You can read our crochet patterns without signing up, creating an account or providing your name to us. We do not currently offer visitor accounts, public comments or a newsletter sign-up form.</p>
        <p>When your browser requests a page, our hosting and security provider, Cloudflare, may process technical request information such as an IP address, requested URLs, timestamps, browser or device information, and security-related signals. This helps deliver the website, protect it from abuse and troubleshoot technical problems.</p>
        <p>We do not ask visitors to provide sensitive personal information to access our tutorials.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="hosting">
        <h2>3. Cloudflare hosting and security</h2>
        <p>Our website is hosted on <strong>Cloudflare Pages</strong> and uses Cloudflare services for delivery, performance and security. Cloudflare processes information necessary to provide these services according to its applicable terms and privacy practices.</p>
        <p>More information is available in <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare’s Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="analytics">
        <h2>4. Website analytics</h2>
        <p>We use <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> to understand overall site usage and performance, such as page views and page-loading measurements. These insights help us identify popular crochet tutorials and improve how the website works.</p>
        <p>Cloudflare states that its Web Analytics service is privacy-focused, does not collect or use visitors’ personal data, and does not track individual visitors across websites. This analytics service does not rely on cookies to follow individual visitors.</p>
        <p>Cloudflare’s website-delivery and security processing is separate from these Web Analytics measurements and may involve the technical information described above.</p>
        <h3>Optional Google Analytics</h3>
        <p>With your consent, we use <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> (Google LLC; measurement ID <code>G-JBSY3YJZ0M</code>) to understand visits, popular pages and interactions with our crochet guides. Google may receive device and browser information, page URLs, interaction events and online identifiers, and may process information internationally. Google Analytics can set cookies such as <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code>, typically lasting up to two years unless cleared or changed by Google or your browser settings.</p>
        <p>We do not load Google Analytics until you accept optional analytics. Rejecting does not block any patterns or lessons. You may change or withdraw your choice at any time using the <strong>Cookie preferences</strong> control in the footer. Learn more in <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="email">
        <h2>5. When you email us</h2>
        <p>If you write to <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a>, we receive the email address you send from, the contents of your message and any information you choose to include. We use this information to read and respond to your request, such as a crochet question, correction, permissions enquiry or privacy request.</p>
        <p>Messages are delivered through the email service configured for our domain and the inbox provider we use. These services process correspondence to deliver and receive emails.</p>
        <p>Please avoid including private or sensitive information that is not needed for your enquiry.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="cookies">
        <h2>6. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
        <p>Cloudflare Web Analytics does not need cookies to track individual visitors. Some features of Cloudflare’s website security or delivery services may use strictly necessary cookies or similar signals, depending on the protections enabled.</p>
        <p>We store an essential preference named <code>thread-petal-consent-v1</code> in your browser's local storage to remember whether you accept optional Google Analytics. This choice expires after about six months, after which we ask again. It remains on your device and is not sent to our server as part of a visitor account.</p>
        <p>When you consent to Google Analytics, Google may set <code>_ga</code> and related analytics cookies. We do not load Google Analytics before consent. You can reject tracking, or withdraw consent later through the <button type="button" id="tp-privacy-cookie-settings" class="policy-consent-button">Cookie preferences</button> control. On withdrawal, the site prevents further analytics tracking and attempts to remove Google Analytics cookies set on our domain; it cannot retract data already sent.</p>
        <p>We do not currently use advertising cookies, and our website source does not enable Google AdSense. If we add advertising in the future, we will update this policy and add the appropriate advertising consent solution.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="advertising">
        <h2>7. Advertising</h2>
        <p>Our tutorials are currently available without third-party display advertisements. We may apply to an advertising service, such as Google AdSense, in the future to help support free crochet content.</p>
        <p>Before enabling such advertising, we will update this section to identify the provider, explain how relevant data and cookies are used, and provide any consent controls required by applicable law.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="external-links">
        <h2>8. External websites and Pinterest</h2>
        <p>Some pages include links or sharing actions that open third-party websites, including Pinterest. If you choose to open an external website, its own privacy policy and practices apply. Linking to an external service does not mean we control its privacy practices.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="why-process">
        <h2>9. Why we process information</h2>
        <p>We process relevant technical information to operate and secure the website, and correspondence to respond to visitors who contact us. Under applicable laws, processing may rely on legitimate interests where permitted, consent where required, or the need to comply with a legal obligation. Our optional Google Analytics use relies on your consent, which you may withdraw using the footer preferences control. Advertising remains disabled.</p>
        <p>Cloudflare Web Analytics uses aggregated performance insights as described above, rather than a visitor account or an individual browsing profile created by Thread & Petal.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sharing-retention">
        <h2>10. Sharing and retention</h2>
        <p>We do not sell visitor information to advertisers or data brokers. Information can be processed by the services needed to operate this site, including Cloudflare, Google Analytics when you consent, and our destination email inbox provider. We may also disclose information where legally required.</p>
        <p>We keep email correspondence only for as long as reasonably needed to address the enquiry, maintain appropriate records or comply with legal duties, after which it is deleted or otherwise handled according to applicable retention practices. Technical records managed by our service providers are subject to their service-specific retention periods and arrangements.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="international">
        <h2>11. International processing</h2>
        <p>Some providers we rely on, including our website hosting and email providers, may process data outside Morocco. International processing is subject to applicable data-protection requirements, which can include CNDP formalities under Moroccan law. Contact us if you have a question about processing related to your message or website visit.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="your-rights">
        <h2>12. Your privacy rights</h2>
        <p>Morocco’s Law 09-08 provides rights in relation to personal data, including the right to be informed, to access relevant information, to request rectification and to object in applicable circumstances. Additional rights, such as erasure, restrictions, portability or withdrawal of consent, may apply under other data-protection laws depending on the circumstances.</p>
        <p>For more information about personal-data protection in Morocco, you can visit the <a href="https://www.cndp.ma/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Commission Nationale de contrôle de la protection des Données à caractère Personnel (CNDP)</a>.</p>
        <p>To make a request, email <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a>. We will review it and respond according to applicable law. Because our Cloudflare Web Analytics does not create a personal browsing account, we may not be able to link aggregated analytics measurements to an individual visitor.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="children">
        <h2>13. Children’s privacy</h2>
        <p>Crochet is a creative activity enjoyed by people of many ages. Our website does not offer accounts or forms designed to collect information from children. If you believe a child has sent us personal information by email and want us to review it, please contact us.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="updates">
        <h2>14. Updates to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may revise this policy when our website changes, when we enable new tools or when legal requirements change. The date near the top of the page shows when it was last updated.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="contact">
        <h2>15. Questions? Get in touch</h2>
        <p>If you have a question about this policy, our crochet website or a privacy request, please email us.</p>
        <p><a class="policy-contact-link" href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>✉ {siteConfig.contactEmail}</a></p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy-consent-button { background: transparent; border: 0; padding: 0; color: #805764; font: inherit; text-decoration: underline; cursor: pointer; }
  .policy-consent-button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #805764; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .policy-wrap{padding-top:48px;padding-bottom:100px;max-width:860px}
  .policy-summary{background:#f4e9e3;border:1px solid #ead9d1;border-radius:18px;padding:23px 26px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}
  .policy-summary-icon{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:33px;color:#b66c83;line-height:1}
  .policy-summary strong{display:block;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:500;color:#63474d;margin-bottom:7px}
  .policy-summary p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#6c5d5a;margin:0}
  .policy-updated{color:#8b7478;font-size:12px;margin:20px 0 25px}
  .policy-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 15px;background:#edf0e7;border-radius:14px;padding:17px 20px;margin:0 0 28px;font-size:13px}
  .policy-nav strong{width:100%;color:#4c6050;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:500}
  .policy-nav a{color:#52684e;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .policy-copy{max-width:none;padding:0;margin:0}
  .policy-copy section{padding:0 0 8px;scroll-margin-top:20px}
  .policy-copy h2{font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,34px)}
  .policy-copy a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .policy-contact-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border-radius:30px;padding:12px 19px;background:#a85e76;color:white!important;text-decoration:none!important;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
  .policy-contact-link:hover{background:#84465a}
  @media(max-width:600px){.policy-wrap{padding-top:30px;padding-bottom:65px}.policy-summary{padding:19px 17px;gap:12px}.policy-summary strong{font-size:21px}.policy-nav{padding:15px}}
</style>
